California State Assemblywoman 

Politics is broken, and Orange County families are paying the price. 

Grocery bills. Gas prices. Utility costs. Everything keeps going up 

while career politicians put special interests or advancing their 

careers ahead of the people they’re supposed to serve. I’ve had 

enough. 

