The most fundamental responsibility of the government is keeping 

families safe. Yet some politicians have embraced a radical, soft-on-

crime ideology that defunded law enforcement and made it harder 

to lock up criminals. Violent crime and robberies in Orange County 

have increased since 2021. It needs to stop. 

As your County Supervisor, I’ll take on the soft-on-crime agenda, 

ensure our deputy sheriffs and first responders have the resources 

they need and I’ll fight to restore law and order. 

Protecting Public Health 

I will protect the health of our communities by opposing 

conventional pesticide use near our schools, parks and waterways. 

