Orange County residents are fed up with taxpayer dollars flowing 

to political allies, backroom deals and decisions made without 

transparency or scrutiny. As your Supervisor, I’ll require competitive 

bidding for contracts, full public disclosure of spending, strict 

conflict-of-interest rules and full oversight before any major vote 

is taken. 

No more political favors. No more excuses. Orange County deserves 

honest leadership and a Supervisor who fights for you. I would be 

honored to earn your vote. 

